      "file": "gem-garden.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 35,
      "zh": "点击两颗相邻晶糖交换，也可按住拖向相邻格。三连收获；四连留下横/竖爆，五连留下星爆。晶糖在花床上消除时会翻松一层土。",
      "en": "Tap two adjacent gems to swap them, or press and drag toward a neighboring cell. Match three to harvest; four leaves a row/column burst, five leaves a star burst. Clearing gems on a bed loosens one layer of soil."
    },
